<title>USA: Baker Hughes to buy Franklin Electric unit.</title>
<headline>Baker Hughes to buy Franklin Electric unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baker Hughes Inc said Tuesday it has entered a definitive agreement to acquire Oil Dynamics Inc from Bluffton, Indiana-based Franklin Electric Co Inc for $31.5 million in cash subject to certain post-closing adjustments.</p>
<p>Oil Dynamics is a manufacturer of electric submersible pumps used to lift crude oil in producing regions worldwide.</p>
<p>The agreement is subject to satisfaction of customary conditions, including clearance by appropriate government agencies, Baker Hughes said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
